  "mach:judgement": "Assess",
  "mach:judgementReason": "Strong research output from Harvard Zitnik Lab — MIT, 619 stars, paper at arXiv (2503.10970) showing 92.1% accuracy on drug reasoning tasks. Assess rather than Adopt because it has no versioned releases and is research software requiring OpenAI API access. High relevance for teams building therapeutic decision support or drug interaction tools.",
